{"name": "Heroes Never Die", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/ed9a7764efa679ac96054ee7b6caa746.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"911\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/ed9a7764efa679ac96054ee7b6caa746.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong><i>Heroes Never Die</i></strong>, strategy is something you feel. Lead your troops across an ever-evolving battlefield where tactical decisions happen in real time. The direction you charge, the formation you choose, and the troops you rally all shape your strategy, building towards one decisive final clash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/eb676fcb97aa6f2f9e88f9bf0ebd947c.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"144\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/eb676fcb97aa6f2f9e88f9bf0ebd947c.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/bd848f511ba42b813338faa5fe7d55a8.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"911\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/bd848f511ba42b813338faa5fe7d55a8.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a thrilling blend of strategic depth and survivor-style intensity. Positioning, upgrades, and army composition all unfold in real time, creating a constant flow of action and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/96a7742fcff9610bf107f7d89aab2658.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"144\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/96a7742fcff9610bf107f7d89aab2658.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/1bccdaf35264fc2f8c5dfddc866118a3.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"911\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/1bccdaf35264fc2f8c5dfddc866118a3.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every hero brings their own powers and strategic advantages to the battlefield. Choose from 20 different heroes, find the one that fits your playstyle, and lead your troops into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/1822b873cb92760631c7efc48a1a01d5.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"144\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/1822b873cb92760631c7efc48a1a01d5.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/9eff8153b05f671fc3918854308bb6a7.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"911\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/9eff8153b05f671fc3918854308bb6a7.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rally troops to your banner and command them through movement and positioning. Where you march and the dynamic formation you choose define how your army fights, turning every second into a tactical choice. Recruit new troops during your run and adapt your battle plan on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/9af7329ca8e8b8b4a35829f024e327ab.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"144\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/9af7329ca8e8b8b4a35829f024e327ab.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/f5336352fcb1405a20bd3cf211fcf976.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"911\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/f5336352fcb1405a20bd3cf211fcf976.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span>From armed militia to blazemaws unleashing fierce blasts from their monstrous mouths, every unit brings something different to the fight. As your army grows, the battlefield erupts with attacks, explosions, and XP as your enemies fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/6ef3a01fffdbe462d9583935d88b2c78.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"144\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/6ef3a01fffdbe462d9583935d88b2c78.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/cc3b295493a6a363b55fdfcf8efc59c6.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"911\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/cc3b295493a6a363b55fdfcf8efc59c6.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Gather gold and resources to raise new buildings, recruit fresh troops, and expand your strategic options. Specialise your units, strengthen your forces, and shape an army worthy of legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/644f6394a42b3c7393d3f2f7d055f4fb.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"144\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/644f6394a42b3c7393d3f2f7d055f4fb.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/a6c7223cb941f2cb55bee471db161681.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"911\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/a6c7223cb941f2cb55bee471db161681.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore, gather, build and fight all while the enemy closes in. Every moment demands a decision: grow your town, hunt for resources, rally new units\u2026 or simply survive what\u2019s coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/4cdb2a2dda7c1d6b86da7c94edbb17e7.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"144\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/4cdb2a2dda7c1d6b86da7c94edbb17e7.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/442a88fb9fad9b1f4d62571980849233.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"911\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/442a88fb9fad9b1f4d62571980849233.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Every 25-minute run tells a complete campaign. Start by exploring and gathering what you can, build an army from the troops you discover, and battle through hordes of creatures on your way to a climactic showdown with a powerful enemy Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras_big/a6e02276a00307df4073d0bdd6a020ea.webp?t=1793204893\" height=\"716\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/extras/a6e02276a00307df4073d0bdd6a020ea.avif?t=1793204893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrilling and tense fusion of strategy and survivor gameplay\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 factions, 20 heroes, and over 60 different units\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time army control through movement and dynamic formation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and upgrade your town to unlock troops and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete a full campaign in ~25 minutes\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High replayability with hero choice and evolving builds</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Choose your hero, rally your troops, and carve a path through hordes of foul creatures in a fast-paced fusion of strategy and survivor gameplay. Grow your army as you march, change your tactics on the fly, and lead soldiers, goblins, minotaurs and more into glorious, chaotic battle.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5275640/fae2612501f0a91b9628f047fa48cd2ce7818a10/header.jpg?t=1793204893", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Action Roguelike", "Action", "Bullet Hell", "Roguelite", "2D"], "developers": "Ludogram", "publishers": "Ludogram", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5275640", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 November 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/-7WkeNSU1PI", "first_seen": 1793919600.0, "review_rank": 12}